IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q12-LOAN-DTI.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INCOME          PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-EXISTING-DEBT   PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-PROPOSED-PAY    PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOT-OBLIG-100   PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
01 WS-INCOME-35       PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-INCOME
ACCEPT WS-EXISTING-DEBT
ACCEPT WS-PROPOSED-PAY
COMPUTE WS-TOT-OBLIG-100 = (WS-EXISTING-DEBT + WS-PROPOSED-PAY) * 100
COMPUTE WS-INCOME-35 = WS-INCOME * 35
IF WS-INCOME > 0 AND WS-TOT-OBLIG-100 <= WS-INCOME-35
    DISPLAY "PASS"
ELSE
    DISPLAY "FAIL"
END-IF
STOP RUN.
